        "action:n12",
        "guard:b2->n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the invoices are still marked as \"Uncompleted\", they should be returned to the client via postal mail."
      ],
      "justification": "The guard correctly isolates the \"Uncompleted\" condition, and the action matches the prescribed return method."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7",
        "action:n14"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the invoices are returned to the client, receive the completed ones."
      ],
      "justification": "Both action nodes faithfully restate the instruction to take receipt of the finished invoices after return."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8",
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Then, mark the relevant box on the invoice entry form and proceed with checking if the process has been completed."
